1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,300
Noor: Payday! Small spending
already took about Dh 600.

2
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:08,750
Most of us learn this
with real money.

3
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:14,170
Compound is a card game where you
practise first, one payday a turn.

4
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:19,350
Play a card three paydays running,
and it becomes a habit.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,950
Noor: My first habit!
From now on it plays itself.

6
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:28,690
Now breakfast takes Dh 300
every payday, without a click.

7
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:32,039
Noor: Just the minimum for now.
I'll clear it later.

8
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:36,312
Noor: The trip went on the card.
I'll be paying for it after Eid.

9
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:39,540
At the minimum,
that's ten years to clear.

10
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:46,400
Four stars judge the year.
One is for enjoying it.

11
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,010
Noor: Next year
I know what to try.

12
00:00:49,350 --> 00:00:52,650
Life gives you one try
at your first salary.

13
00:00:52,930 --> 00:00:55,350
Compound gives you
the same year again.

14
00:00:57,100 --> 00:00:59,710
Same luck.
Only your choices change.

15
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:02,180
Noor: This time, I save first.

16
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:08,530
Now Dh 1,000 goes to savings
every payday, without a click.

17
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:11,010
Noor: Real, or a scam?

18
00:01:11,350 --> 00:01:13,760
Check it yourself,
in the official app.

19
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:20,960
Noor: Flights booked.
I'm going home for Eid!

20
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:24,720
Same surgery.
Insurance pays most of it.

21
00:01:25,600 --> 00:01:27,980
Noor: A star on all four
this year!

22
00:01:28,600 --> 00:01:32,910
First, the year happens to you.
Then you plan it.

23
00:01:33,250 --> 00:01:38,070
Every year ends with one thing
to try on your next real payday.

24
00:01:38,650 --> 00:01:43,430
Arabic and English, with a guide
for a forty-five-minute class.

25
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:48,550
Next, the same game for other lives:
a college student,

26
00:01:48,820 --> 00:01:52,520
Ahmed's five years, twenty years,
and your own year.

27
00:01:53,500 --> 00:01:56,210
Play Noor's year.
Then play it again.
